(6318,37,450,'paragraph',NULL,'In Fig. 4.10, slope = – Chemical_Kinetics-image10.png and intercept = ln A. So we can calculate E a and A using these values.','[{"s": "In Fig. 4.10, slope = –", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Chemical_Kinetics-image10.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "and intercept = ln A.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "So we can calculate E", "t": "text"}, {"s": "a", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and A using these values.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
