(2279,21,158,'paragraph',NULL,'The floral formula is represented by some symbols. In the floral formula, Br stands for bracteate K stands for calyx , C for corolla, P for perianth, A for androecium and G for Gynoecium, G','[{"s": "", "t": "br"}, {"s": "The floral formula is represented by some symbols. In the floral formula, Br stands for bracteate K stands for calyx , C for corolla, P for perianth, A for androecium and G for Gynoecium,", "t": "text"}, {"s": "G", "t": "text"}, {"s": "", "t": "br"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
