(3065,26,196,'paragraph',NULL,'26. With the help of a schematic diagram describe the haplo diptontic life cycle pattern of a plant group.','[{"s": "26.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "With the help of a schematic diagram describe the haplo diptontic life cycle pattern of a plant group.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3066,26,197,'paragraph',NULL,'27. Lichen is usually cited as an example of ‘symbiosis’ in plants where an algal and a fungal species live together for their mutual benefit. Which of the following will happen if algal and fungal partners are separated from each other?','[{"s": "27.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Lichen is usually cited as an example of ‘symbiosis’ in plants where an algal and a fungal species live together for their mutual benefit. Which of the following will happen if algal and fungal partners are separated from each other?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3067,26,198,'paragraph',NULL,'(a) Both will survive and grow normally and independent from each other.','[{"s": "(a) Both will survive and grow normally and independent from each other.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3068,26,199,'paragraph',NULL,'(b) Both will die','[{"s": "(b) Both will die", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3069,26,200,'paragraph',NULL,'(c) Algal component will survive while the fungal componentwilldie.','[{"s": "(c) Algal component will survive while the fungal componentwilldie.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3070,26,201,'paragraph',NULL,'(d) Fungal component will survive while algal partner will die.','[{"s": "(d) Fungal component will survive while algal partner will die.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3071,26,202,'paragraph',NULL,'Based on your answer how do you justify this association as symbiosis?','[{"s": "Based on your answer how do you justify this association as symbiosis?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(3072,26,203,'paragraph',NULL,'28. Explain why sexual reproduction in angiosperms is said to take place through double fertilisation and triple fusion. Also draw a labelled diagram of embryo sac to explain the phenomena.','[{"s": "28.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Explain why sexual reproduction in angiosperms is said to take place through double fertilisation and triple fusion. Also draw a labelled diagram of embryo sac to explain the phenomena.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
