(3367,29,48,'paragraph',NULL,'We have till now seen that glucose has been broken down to release CO 2 and eight molecules of NADH + H + ; two of FADH 2 have been synthesised besides just two molecules of ATP in TCA cycle. You may be wondering why we have been discussing respiration at all – neither O 2 has come into the picture nor the promised large number of ATP has yet been synthesised. Also what is the role of the NADH + H + and FADH 2 that is synthesised? Let us now understand the role of O 2 in respiration and how ATP is synthesised.','[{"s": "We have till now seen that glucose has been broken down to release CO", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and eight molecules of NADH + H", "t": "text"}, {"s": "+", "t": "text"}, {"s": "; two of FADH", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "have been synthesised besides just two molecules of ATP in TCA cycle. You may be wondering why we have been discussing respiration at all – neither O", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "has come into the picture nor the promised large number of ATP has yet been synthesised. Also what is the role of the NADH + H", "t": "text"}, {"s": "+", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and FADH", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "that is synthesised? Let us now understand the role of O", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "in respiration and how ATP is synthesised.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
