(3509,30,102,'paragraph',NULL,'Following double fertilisation, events of endosperm and embryo development, maturation of ovule(s) into seed(s) and ovary into fruit, are collectively termed post-fertilisation events.','[{"s": "Following double fertilisation, events of endosperm and embryo development, maturation of ovule(s) into seed(s) and ovary into fruit, are collectively termed", "t": "text"}, {"s": "post-fertilisation events.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
