(3956,34,20,'paragraph',NULL,'Benzylic alcohols : In these alcohols, the —OH group is attached to a sp 3 —hybridised carbon atom next to an aromatic ring. For example.','[{"s": "Benzylic alcohols", "t": "text"}, {"s": ": In these alcohols, the —OH group is attached to a sp", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": "—hybridised carbon atom next to an aromatic ring. For example.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
