(4222,34,286,'paragraph',NULL,'Oxidation of phenol with chromic acid produces a conjugated diketone known as benzoquinone. In the presence of air, phenols are slowly oxidised to dark coloured mixtures containing quinones.','[{"s": "Oxidation of phenol with chromic acid produces a conjugated diketone known as benzoquinone.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "In the presence of air, phenols are slowly oxidised to dark coloured mixtures containing quinones.", "t": "text"}]','marked','["250895"]',NULL),
