(4230,34,294,'paragraph',NULL,'11.8 Ortho and para nitrophenols are more acidic than phenol. Draw the resonance structures of the corresponding phenoxide ions.','[{"s": "11.8 Ortho and para nitrophenols are more acidic than phenol. Draw the resonance structures of the corresponding phenoxide ions.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
