(9216,41,748,'paragraph',NULL,'(iii) Which element of the first transition series as lowest third ionisation enthalpy?','[{"s": "(iii) Which element of the first transition series as lowest third ionisation enthalpy?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
