(6124,37,256,'paragraph',NULL,'Let p i be the initial pressure of A and p t the total pressure at time ‘t’. Integrated rate equation for such a reaction can be derived as','[{"s": "Let p", "t": "text"}, {"s": "i", "t": "text"}, {"s": "be the initial pressure of A and p", "t": "text"}, {"s": "t", "t": "text"}, {"s": "the total pressure at time ‘t’. Integrated rate equation for such a reaction can be derived as", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
