(6127,37,259,'paragraph',NULL,'If x atm be the decrease in pressure of A at time t and one mole each of B and C is being formed, the increase in pressure of B and C will also be x atm each.','[{"s": "If x atm be the decrease in pressure of A at time t and one mole each of B and C is being formed, the increase in pressure of B and C will also be x atm each.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
