(6184,37,316,'paragraph',NULL,'The half-life of a reaction is the time in which the concentration of a reactant is reduced to one half of its initial concentration. 7 It is represented as t 1/2 .','[{"s": "The half-life of a reaction is the time in which the concentration of a reactant is reduced to one half of its initial concentration.", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "7", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "It is represented as t", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "1/2", "t": "hl"}, {"s": ".", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["181040", "181041", "181043", "181068", "181069", "181070", "181071"]',NULL),
