(6226,37,358,'paragraph',NULL,'The concentration of water does not get altered much during the course of the reaction. So, the reaction behaves as first order reaction. Such reactions are called pseudo first order reactions.','[{"s": "The concentration of water does not get altered much during the course of the reaction. So, the reaction behaves as first order reaction. Such reactions are called pseudo first order reactions.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
