(7190,38,440,'paragraph',NULL,'So in oxygen molecule, atoms are held by a double bond. Moreover, it may be noted that it contains two unpaired electrons in Chemical_bonding-image43.png 2px and Chemical_bonding-image1.png 2py molecular orbitals, therefore, O 2 molecule should be paramagnetic, a prediction that corresponds to experimental observation . In this way, the theory successfully explains the paramagnetic nature of oxygen.','[{"s": "So in oxygen molecule, atoms are held by a double bond. Moreover, it may be noted that it contains two unpaired electrons in", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Chemical_bonding-image43.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "2px and", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Chemical_bonding-image1.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "2py molecular orbitals, therefore,", "t": "text"}, {"s": "O", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "molecule should be paramagnetic, a prediction that corresponds to experimental observation", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}, {"s": "In this way, the theory successfully explains the paramagnetic nature of oxygen.", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["41950"]',NULL),
(7191,38,441,'paragraph',NULL,'Similarly, the electronic configurations of other homonuclear diatomic molecules of the second row of the periodic table can be written. In Fig.4.21 are given the molecular orbital occupancy and molecular properties for B 2 through Ne 2 . The sequence of MOs and their electron population are shown. The bond energy, bond length, bond order, magnetic properties and valence electron configuration appear below the orbital diagrams.','[{"s": "Similarly, the electronic configurations of other homonuclear diatomic molecules of the second row of the periodic table can be written. In Fig.4.21 are given the molecular orbital occupancy and molecular properties for B", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "through Ne", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": ". The sequence of MOs and their electron population are shown. The bond energy, bond length, bond order, magnetic properties and valence electron configuration appear below the orbital diagrams.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
