(7284,39,4,'paragraph',NULL,'• appreciate how the concept of grouping elements in accordance to their properties led to the development of Periodic Table.','[{"s": "•", "t": "text"}, {"s": "appreciate how the concept of grouping elements in accordance to their properties led to the development of Periodic Table.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
