(7646,39,366,'paragraph',NULL,'Thus, process of formation of O 2- in gas phase is unfavourable even though O 2- is isoelectronic with neon. It is due to the fact that','[{"s": "Thus, process of formation of O", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2-", "t": "text"}, {"s": "in gas phase is unfavourable even though O", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2-", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is isoelectronic with neon. It is due to the fact that", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
