(9368,42,146,'paragraph',NULL,'Thus, from the measurement of E Ɵ (cell) we can obtain an important thermodynamic quantity, ∆ r G J, standard Gibbs energy of the reaction . From the latter we can calculate equilibrium constant by the equation:','[{"s": "Thus, from the measurement of E", "t": "text"}, {"s": "Ɵ", "t": "text"}, {"s": "(cell)", "t": "text"}, {"s": "we can obtain an important thermodynamic quantity, ∆", "t": "text"}, {"s": "r", "t": "text"}, {"s": "G", "t": "text"}, {"s": "J, standard Gibbs energy of the reaction", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}, {"s": "From the latter we can calculate equilibrium constant by the equation:", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["171119"]',NULL),
