(9454,42,232,'paragraph',NULL,'The electrical resistance of a column of 0.05 mol L –1 NaOH solution of diameter 1 cm and length 50 cm is 5.55 × 10 3 ohm. Calculate its resistivity, conductivity and molar conductivity.','[{"s": "The electrical resistance of a column of 0.05 mol L", "t": "text"}, {"s": "–1", "t": "text"}, {"s": "NaOH solution of diameter 1 cm and length 50 cm is 5.55 × 10", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": "ohm. Calculate its resistivity, conductivity and molar conductivity.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
