(10004,42,782,'paragraph',NULL,'(ii) If cell A’ has E cell = 0.5V and cell ‘B’ has E cell = 1.1 V then what will be the reactions at anode and cathode?','[{"s": "(ii) If cell A’ has E", "t": "text"}, {"s": "cell", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 0.5V and cell ‘B’ has E", "t": "text"}, {"s": "cell", "t": "text"}, {"s": "= 1.1 V then what will be the reactions at anode and cathode?", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
