(10120,43,106,'paragraph',NULL,'where A and B are the reactants, C and D are the products in the balanced chemical equation. On the basis of experimental studies of many reversible reactions, the Norwegian chemists Cato Maximillian Guldberg and Peter Waage proposed in 1864 that the concentrations in an equilibrium mixture are related by the following equilibrium equation,','[{"s": "where A and B are the reactants, C and D are the products in the balanced chemical equation.", "t": "text"}, {"s": "On the basis of experimental studies of many reversible reactions, the Norwegian chemists Cato Maximillian Guldberg and Peter Waage proposed in 1864 that the concentrations in an equilibrium mixture are related by the following", "t": "hl"}, {"s": "equilibrium equation,", "t": "hl"}]','marked','["71134"]',NULL),
(10121,43,107,'paragraph',NULL,'Equilibrium-image42.png (7.1) where K c is the equilibrium constant and the expression on the right side is called the equilibrium constant expression .','[{"s": "Equilibrium-image42.png", "t": "img", "alt": ""}, {"s": "(7.1) where", "t": "text"}, {"s": "K", "t": "text"}, {"s": "c", "t": "text"}, {"s": "is the", "t": "text"}, {"s": "equilibrium constant", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and the expression on the right side is called the", "t": "text"}, {"s": "equilibrium constant expression", "t": "text"}, {"s": ".", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
(10122,43,108,'paragraph',NULL,'The equilibrium equation is also known as the law of mass action because in the early days of chemistry, concentration was called “active mass”. In order to appreciate their work better, let us consider reaction between gaseous H 2 and I 2 carried out in a sealed vessel at 731K.','[{"s": "The equilibrium equation is also known as the", "t": "text"}, {"s": "law of mass action", "t": "text"}, {"s": "because in the early days of chemistry, concentration was called “active mass”. In order to appreciate their work better, let us consider reaction between gaseous H", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "and I", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "carried out in a sealed vessel at 731K.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
