(10665,43,651,'paragraph',NULL,'Consider a weak acid HX that is partially ionized in the aqueous solution. The equilibrium can be expressed by:','[{"s": "Consider a weak acid HX that is partially ionized in the aqueous solution. The equilibrium can be expressed by:", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
