(10820,43,806,'paragraph',NULL,'As the concentration of water remains constant it has been omitted from the denominator and incorporated within the dissociation constant. Then multiplying and dividing the above expression by [H + ], we get:','[{"s": "As the concentration of water remains constant it has been omitted from the denominator and incorporated within the dissociation constant. Then multiplying and dividing the above expression by [H", "t": "text"}, {"s": "+", "t": "text"}, {"s": "], we get:", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
