(11253,44,23,'paragraph',NULL,'These are the compounds in which the halogen atom is bonded to an sp 3 -hybridised carbon atom attached to an aromatic ring.','[{"s": "These are the compounds in which the halogen atom is bonded to an sp", "t": "text"}, {"s": "3", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-hybridised carbon atom attached to an aromatic ring.", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
