(11258,44,28,'paragraph',NULL,'These are the compounds in which the halogen atom is bonded to a sp 2 -hybridised carbon atom of a carbon-carbon double bond (C = C).','[{"s": "These are the compounds in which the halogen atom is bonded to a sp", "t": "text"}, {"s": "2", "t": "text"}, {"s": "-hybridised carbon atom of a carbon-carbon double bond (C = C).", "t": "text"}]',NULL,NULL,NULL),
